        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use of fixed IP access network per GB
The data set represents the mix of fixed network in Switzerland; UUID: f38a0b30-a3b5-32e5-a005-0d50c20ed972
The datasets represents the split of fixed networks (cable, optic fibre, xDSL) in Switzerland for the reference year of 2014. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: The mix of Swiss access transmission network, fixed.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f38a0b30-a3b5-32e5-a005-0d50c20ed972.xml</text>
